.TH "GCM-VIEWER" "1" "11 April,2008" "" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
gcm-viewer \- GNOME Color Manager Profile Viewer Tool
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBgcm-viewer\fR [ \fB--verbose\fR ]

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This manual page documents briefly the \fBgcm-viewer\fR command.
.PP
\fBgcm-viewer\fR allows you to view properties of ICC files.
